  1027:<h2 id="tutorial_annotations">3. Tutorial Using Native Hibernate APIs and Annotation Mappings</h2>
  1165:<h2 id="tutorial_jpa">4. Tutorial Using the Java Persistence API (Jakarta Persistence)</h2>
