ned in-memory EntityManagerFactory and dialect coverage.\"},{\"kind\":\"dependency\",\"coordinate\":\"org.postgresql:postgresql:42.3.8\",\"scope\":\"testImplementation\",\"reason\":\"PostgreSQLDialect initialization references PostgreSQL driver types even when tests use H2 PostgreSQL mode.\"},{\"kind\":\"dependency\",\"coordinate\":\"com.oracle.database.jdbc:ojdbc11:23.2.0.0\",\"scope\":\"testImplementation\",\"reason\":\"OracleDialect initialization references Oracle JDBC types even when tests use H2 Oracle mode.\"}],\"agent_guidance\":\"Bootstrap Hibernate through a `META-INF/persistence.xml` persistence unit backed by an H2 in-memory JDBC URL. Set `hibernate.bytecode.provider=none` (for example in `hibernate.properties`) to avoid bytecode-provider requirements during native-image-oriented tests. Exercise dialects with H2 modes rather than Docker databases.\",\"risks\":[\"H2 compatibility modes do not fully reproduce PostgreSQL, Oracle, MySQL, MariaDB, or SQL Server behavior; Local Gradle and Native Image verification must determine whether real database coverage is required.\"]}", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0c66e1fe53f76537016a68af8b6af0819ab74a361e58343ea1\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-terra", "usage": {"input": 2852, "output": 952, "cacheRead": 22528, "cacheWrite": 0, "totalTokens": 26332, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1785245566239, "responseId": "resp_0c66e1fe53f76537016a68af7ec230819a923532cec9a183db"}}
